	measure 'Energy of GNI Above Average' = ```
			
			VAR OverallAverage = 
			    CALCULATE(
			        AVERAGE('Fact Country Data'[GNI per capita]), 
			        ALLSELECTED('Fact Country Data')
			    )
			RETURN
			    CALCULATE(
			        AVERAGE('Fact Country Data'[Renewable Energy Score]),
			        KEEPFILTERS('Fact Country Data'[GNI per capita] > OverallAverage)
			    )
			```
